WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.372 --> 00:00:03.269
You don't fail because
of one bad decision.

2
00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:07.345
I said you fail because you made
small bad decisions,

3
00:00:08.103 --> 00:00:08.996
day after day.

4
00:00:09.698 --> 00:00:11.364
And success is the same.

5
00:00:12.323 --> 00:00:14.606
When I meet someone, I watch the habits.

6
00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:16.460
Do they get up in the morning?

7
00:00:16.941 --> 00:00:17.931
Are they structured?

8
00:00:18.387 --> 00:00:20.105
Do they start the day positive?

9
00:00:20.894 --> 00:00:22.876
Relationships work like that too.

10
00:00:23.515 --> 00:00:26.589
If you don't work at them every day,
they drift into neglect.

11
00:00:27.192 --> 00:00:29.565
I also look for the defining moments
in a life:

12
00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:31.179
a hard one,

13
00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:32.422
a lesson,

14
00:00:33.141 --> 00:00:34.416
a decision it led to.

15
00:00:35.028 --> 00:00:36.427
Write three defining moments.

16
00:00:37.027 --> 00:00:40.516
Write the emotion, the action
and the decision each led to.

